&lt;li&gt;Run a hybrid pipeline motion: act on product-led signals early in the week, then shift into outbound prospecting for the bulk of your time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify prospects through calls, emails, and social media (LinkedIn) to generate sales-ready meetings for Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
