&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring the will;we&#39;ll teach you the skill. Hardworking, intellectually curious, and coachable matter more to us than pedigree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have grit and are comfortable with volume and rejection. Outbound requires consistency, and you show up for it every day.&lt;/li&gt;
