&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re AI-fluent, or eager to get there fast. We use AI tools throughout our sales motion, and you’re excited to learn how to use them to work smarter and more effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have - in a EMEA wide team - if happen to speak fluent French or German in addition to English it is useful but not a requirement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The OTE target earnings for this role are £70,000 - £74,000 (depending on experience level) based at our EMEA HQ in Borough Yards, London.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work starts with feeling supported, that’s why we’ve built a benefits package designed to help you thrive both inside and outside of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;: £7,500 annual allowance to cover your commute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt;: Top-tier private medical, dental, and vision coverage through AXA, with heavily subsidised plans available for dependants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Up to £7,200 per year through Carrot to support your path to parenthood, plus a minimum of 16 weeks fully paid maternity or paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
